        "type": "base",
        "_id": "tcp8tNGV7Zb2lqZ3",
        "description": "<p>Your companion moves up to a number of squares equal to [[lookup @I]]{their Intuition score} straight toward the closest enemy they are aware of, avoiding damaging terrain and ending the movement when they are adjacent to that enemy.</p><p>Your companion then makes the following power roll:</p>",
        "before": true
      },
      "UROr39v1DDLwgpUm": {
        "sort": 200000,
        "name": "",
        "img": null,
        "type": "base",
        "_id": "UROr39v1DDLwgpUm",
        "description": "<p>This ability gains the following benefit based on your wild nature.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Guardian:</strong> Each enemy target is [[/apply taunted]] by your companion until the start of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prowler:</strong> Each enemy target is [[/apply weakened]] until the start of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Punisher:</strong> Your companion slides each target up to a number of squares equal to [[lookup @M]]{their Might score}.</p></li><li><p><strong>Spark:</strong> This strike deals [[/damage @scaling type=cold/fire/lightning/sonic scaling]]{cold, fire, lightning, or sonic} damage. You [[/gain 1 surge]]{gain 1 surge}.</p></li></ul>",
